{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018eTMKSMupqTBoPUbWsN7SQ","type":"tool_result","content":"test test_and_pattern_with_forward_slash ... ok\nwarning: `fd-find` (test \"tests\") generated 14 warnings (run `cargo clippy --fix --test \"tests\" -p fd-find -- ` to apply 14 suggestions)\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 6.17s\n3:## Features\n4:- Add `--ignore-parent` option to override `--no-ignore-parent`, see #1958 (@tmchow)\n5:- Add `--exact` option to match the entire filename exactly (literal, non-substring).\n7:## Bugfixes\n8:- Handle invalid working directories gracefully when using `--full-path`, see #1900 (@Xavrir).\n9:- Fire the \"search pattern contains a path separator\" diagnostic for any pattern containing `/`, not just patterns that happen to name an existing directory. Preserves the legacy Windows behaviour that also flags native `\\` separators when the pattern resolves to a real directory. See #1873.\n10:- Fix bug where passing \"-\" as a directory argument didn't actually search that directory, see #849 (@Sean-Kenneth-Doherty).\n14:## Bugfixes","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d4d5b15d-f1c4-4f0f-8505-da71980ba186","uuid":"a33a0055-b17f-41fe-a880-81444bd3f5f7","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:49:16.462Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"test test_and_pattern_with_forward_slash ... ok\nwarning: `fd-find` (test \"tests\") generated 14 warnings (run `cargo clippy --fix --test \"tests\" -p fd-find -- ` to apply 14 suggestions)\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 6.17s\n3:## Features\n4:- Add `--ignore-parent` option to override `--no-ignore-parent`, see #1958 (@tmchow)\n5:- Add `--exact` option to match the entire filename exactly (literal, non-substring).\n7:## Bugfixes\n8:- Handle invalid working directories gracefully when using `--full-path`, see #1900 (@Xavrir).\n9:- Fire the \"search pattern contains a path separator\" diagnostic for any pattern containing `/`, not just patterns that happen to name an existing directory. Preserves the legacy Windows behaviour that also flags native `\\` separators when the pattern resolves to a real directory. See #1873.\n10:- Fix bug where passing \"-\" as a directory argument didn't actually search that directory, see #849 (@Sean-Kenneth-Doherty).\n14:## Bugfixes","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018eTMKSMupqTBoPUbWsN7SQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
